<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="bb5e0947bdb847d491ff903699c1a078">说明：策略一步化布控</km-title>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="60512bbb182c4be4a176487f488c3cc5">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="84933dae89e94de0b493e5fda19882e8"><span color="#7F7F7F"><em>“配置一条完整的策略需要来回切换？”</em></span><br /><span color="#7F7F7F"><em>“要先创建好规则才能配置策略？”</em></span><br /><span color="#7F7F7F"><em>“策略上线忘记配置监控熔断导致误伤/漏过？”</em></span><br />为解决操作链路过长，策略布控操作步骤零散不同功能TAB等问题，一步化布控提供<strong>在同一个页面从0-1完成策略配置到策略上线的策略布控方式</strong>。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="aff9300a3c2d4af28a509fc0a3c3f33f" />
<h1 nodeId="e9e80daf2995443089048c8c6761f6ca"><span font-size="19">策略链路整体概览</span></h1>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136634099326?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="906" height="246" nodeId="3957d48155e5498aa88d1013477606fe" />
<p nodeId="a52dfdf67c02428a9f717877dd689875"><strong>功能入口：</strong><a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/scene" title="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/scene" nodeId="02198e51231f49609e4253181cc2a624">https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/scene</a>（覆盖Zeus策略 增/删/改/查 流程）<br /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136644308047?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="548" height="274" nodeId="0a7c118f6d21431c858a93522429b1c1" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136743274163?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="262" height="279" nodeId="8eb7e2f16dad4b6f814db2767574809c" /></p>
<h1 nodeId="964aca2351dd42d19e46312c17fb16ac"><span font-size="19">Step1-配置流量</span></h1>
<blockquote nodeId="6ed56aeafe29486ea309e0564d7720b3">
<p nodeId="3093109f4bfb41eeb7bfe1223ecb057f">策略的流量来源是什么？<br />可选择当前空间下的已有Zeus场景，对应场景关联事件流量后续将执行该条场景配置</p>
</blockquote>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="c3b4a82608434f94bb07e0b03d958ef1">
<tr nodeId="fd204878c9aa42dfb48870f616a530e1">
<th colwidth="[606]" nodeId="cf2c00368bd444cab88c2528f42dc92c">
<p nodeId="82c7e08bcc1947b195b25fb5e27d2c1a">操作说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[400]" nodeId="8dbf382f58dc4851933526e97faf3acb">
<p nodeId="0e266585cc6441db93b77451a804da85">示意图</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="c840b30cf7294b74bd431b56d4beaf52">
<td colwidth="[606]" nodeId="fc52af3a96694bc48f0f2cc6b5413981">
<ol nodeId="8b161b87213b4a86ac4c5a0b13a3f1a8">
<li nodeId="669fe32265964194bd599f4d1467aeb1">选择已有场景，根据已有场景所关联的事件，可确认进入当前策略的流量来源。</li>
</ol>
<km-note type="info" nodeId="05511967c89c4cf6b0ebc1f435a1d842">
<km-title>Q:我的场景没有关联事件流量？我该如何处理？</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="69ea6c3701e949788f38667ba538795d">A：事件到场景的关联映射关系需要策略同学在Tatooine平台上为事件映射对应的场景。平台链接：<a href="https://hansolo.vip.sankuai.com/#/eventManageList" title="https://hansolo.vip.sankuai.com/#/eventManageList" nodeId="ab4af03ea4a4409c88113e7255ce2f6d">https://hansolo.vip.sankuai.com/#/eventManageList</a><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136684691768?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1205.65" height="600" nodeId="40e2ee404d964ab59007f88598a96a12" /></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[400]" nodeId="a29f67b599744126a198a70e202e7a59">
<p nodeId="561096bda9c84f1db4a2907aadfa93fc"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136677546215?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1210.73" height="600" nodeId="1d6099cae06a4fc198298b1a0bc8add7" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136699669584?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1246.1" height="600" nodeId="814c1044134547249c376a178f47811c" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h1 nodeId="6d981a7c9a7c4b829b4eb3db0cb0974f"><span font-size="19">Step2-配置识别逻辑</span></h1>
<blockquote nodeId="c3a75e6930c54fab944145cad8960214">
<p nodeId="d26fc0aaa4964cdf8052b4eaff812681">如何判定流量是否存在风险？<br />可在当前页面新建一条规则或选择使用已有规则对流量中的请求信息进行风险识别</p>
</blockquote>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="3b6ba67b9b564c0fbc08c899598942f6">
<tr nodeId="67567dc7a7bc439586611c3a903eccf3">
<th colwidth="[625]" nodeId="2e3bb067bcc14b6a8d05dc0a624a01b9">
<p nodeId="35c3f3602264412d8931237c1f3ea86a">操作说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[400]" nodeId="358a1a2e06304ab4988a7ee2064303dd">
