</tr>
<tr nodeId="350361c74c3c4c96b8af026895a632e7">
<td colwidth="[625]" nodeId="d270d5cd86b643a386922529c6c77a1c">
<p nodeId="3b9988c084554768b72e71b5dba1c55e">【单条】</p>
<ol nodeId="ecb1cd6b643e4be292ccf6b819e2a04e">
<li nodeId="2a2d52ebf49d46018910819ba8e37efc">在当前页面新建规则，并对规则内容完成测试。创建方式参考：<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/312585969" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/312585969" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="77c980551a20469da1b590a2d16545f4">https://km.sankuai.com/page/312585969</a></li>
<li nodeId="93ad93a84cd841848e3e038c3bfc8941">选择当前已有规则。</li>
</ol>
<p nodeId="193eb05599b545879f2404b8caae3efe">【批量】</p>
<ol nodeId="ce58b66a76a449aaa500eb69cbd39e65">
<li nodeId="2743fbfc072d435d853579e6b5f363f4">选择已有规则组/规则标签添加，</li>
</ol>
</td>
<td colwidth="[400]" nodeId="56e984e709ad4a2a9d370140dd180cf3">
<p nodeId="596f5f7b3a7c4e09a325c7eb90863c58"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136674981937?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="169" height="82" nodeId="1bf836ec973e4aa59ed86affb7f3a5a1" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136713852353?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="169" height="85" nodeId="fcab0bbdfef544d5ab3d8f73790f9737" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="1b20458a063247ef8a19808edf59571a">
<td colwidth="[625]" nodeId="aef88e972b3048258e541c3e82cd452f">
<p nodeId="a9ab66684e6349abb150daa566ba0ce5">点击规则右上方「打开调试工具」，对新创建的规则或所使用的已有规则逻辑进行测试。</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[400]" nodeId="dac8642edebf4651856c1a42b0327918">
<p nodeId="82e1d7a034834b36ba90ed99be450c32"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2611570191/136720953058?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1210.73" height="600" nodeId="8b5a01dc9b924a98a4f590d3889f6903" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h1 nodeId="c899aa430f90404d88e5788b8099d126"><span font-size="19">Step3-配置执行决策</span></h1>
<blockquote nodeId="47df6cedddab4b97a93a2a06bf879da9">
<p nodeId="27011ac5e54246738bb02355977d9dc4">需要对存在风险的请求执行什么动作？<br />可在当前页面选择使用已有决策，决策及其附加信息/决策理由在执行规则命中后会输出给调用方</p>
</blockquote>
