<li nodeId="7323db5bee0343bdb4583b361cd473fe">
<p nodeId="ce600de5952143b6a8b676d5bf83f96d">当请求存在风险命中step2的识别规则时，执行此处配置的决策、附加信息、决策理由等信息。</p>
<p nodeId="ce3eb56674ca4e21a115ba0442f4b035">决策：<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="094b677349f74d488c69d93c1d3d9e7d">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813</a></p>
<p nodeId="e1a11ac1bb054e248f397a37ce8a92b9">附加信息：<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/28253486" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/28253486" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="8d85b301fbac46d2b53e7509a6aea902">https://km.sankuai.com/page/28253486</a></p>
<p nodeId="4b9285c60b71461696233fa03bb1ec7f">决策理由：<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/304311873" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/304311873" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="4073a1bef73e4513addb0670987bb58b">https://km.sankuai.com/page/304311873</a></p>
