</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="e11d95fd8a434f13b86c333b5c4d2d10">
<td colwidth="[643]" nodeId="603516f86ab0420aad840c9a388d56f6">
<ol nodeId="00ac290bd05a41a69cde6dd526b171dd">
<li nodeId="b0b74f69296e431db033735dc7365f66">
<p nodeId="44bac3dabd3947d8a994d461f9640977">为策略设定当前执行状态及优先级。</p>
<ol nodeId="a1b4929552fc468fa7ee1be3e1135325">
<li nodeId="74227d9c216b4f3698a3ca6af9ef984a">
<p nodeId="4650c15c90eb46f3a44e45c7b3dc7d2c">状态：</p>
<p nodeId="dfb8e5217a0948ba9eaf033e13efc414"><span font-size="12">生效：正常执行并返回决策给业务方/ 标记：正常执行但结果仅落日志不返回业务方 / 离线：不执行该条策略</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="90fdd17ae6724e6ba14628b76915afda">
<p nodeId="b9b7e3bb82994565b3c897415728451a"><span font-size="15">优先级：</span></p>
<p nodeId="68ae0adfc1e344f5b568326951b1a3a2"><span font-size="12">多条策略同时命中后，下游将根据优先级对最终命中策略进行合并，数字越小优先级越高</span></p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
