<h1 nodeId="ffa195e6a9624f0dad9465968e04cf15"><span font-size="19">Step5-配置监控熔断</span></h1>
<blockquote nodeId="f975ca9960234edfb2c66a77a292baa0">
<p nodeId="79ce9d7ea9bb425f9b17c4b4870ed76c">策略上线之后担心命中不符合预期？<br />可在当前页面对于当前策略（当前场景*当前规则*当前决策纬度）设定监控&amp;熔断波动检测配置。</p>
</blockquote>
<p nodeId="d7709a26b08c4927abb45afaa16bf7db">根据<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/2581602012" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/2581602012" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="692de8631bf34f7c8fefb66c21d086fb">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/2581602012</a>，已要求强卡控1/3/4/5/152/184空间策略发布时每条策略都需要有监控/熔断配置。如有修改诉求，可联系<km-mention name="刘思淼" uid="liusimiao" empId="" nodeId="92f0d67e2221496ea3e5a372ca608faf" />。</p>
